   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Two freighters, assisted by tugboats, are preparing to transit the Panama Canal starting at Gatun Locks on the Atlantic side. These container ships are fully loaded with cargo heading west towards the Pacific.&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
